1
00:00:00,243 --> 00:00:02,813
(Raj:)or Koothrapemily?

2
00:00:02,813 --> 00:00:06,553
(Howard:)Why is it your last name
and her first name?

3
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:08,480
(Raj:)Oh, well,
her last name is Sweeney,

4
00:00:08,485 --> 00:00:12,655
(Raj:)and something just didn't seem
right about Koothrapeeney.

5
00:00:14,624 --> 00:00:17,354
(Leonard:)Hey, how'd it go
with human resources?

6
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,830
(Sheldon:)Awful.

7
00:00:18,829 --> 00:00:21,199
Yeah, they're allowing me
to move on from string theory,

8
00:00:21,198 --> 00:00:23,128
(Sheldon:)but they made me
a junior professor

9
00:00:23,133 --> 00:00:25,403
(Sheldon:)and are requiring me
to teach a class.

10
00:00:25,402 --> 00:00:28,132
(Raj:)I don't understand. Why is it
bad that you have to teach?

11
00:00:28,138 --> 00:00:30,468
(Sheldon:)What a stupid question.

12
00:00:31,474 --> 00:00:34,944
(Leonard:)The kids are
gonna love him.

13
00:00:34,945 --> 00:00:36,975
(Sheldon:)I can't believe
I have to waste my time

14
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:39,150
(Sheldon:)babysitting a bunch
of grad students

15
00:00:39,149 --> 00:00:43,119
(Sheldon:)who probably think dark matter
is what's in their diapers.

16
00:00:43,119 --> 00:00:44,649
(Leonard:)This might not be that bad.

17
00:00:44,654 --> 00:00:46,854
(Leonard:)Uh, you like telling people
they're wrong.

18
00:00:46,857 --> 00:00:48,127
Wrong!

19
00:00:49,659 --> 00:00:52,599
(Sheldon:)Just because I enjoyed that one
doesn't mean I always do.

20
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:55,300
(Raj:)You enjoy giving
people grades.

21
00:00:55,298 --> 00:00:59,398
(Sheldon:)A valid point,
but unoriginal-- B-minus.

